1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,231
I always sat in the back seat growing
up.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,781
Listening to my family laugh and talk.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,911
Watching my older siblings take the
wheel.

4
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,091
Then came the day I sat in the driver's
seat.

5
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:30,291
My hands gripped the wheel so tight.

6
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,121
Checking the mirror over and over.

7
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:43,891
Now, late at night, my phone lights up.

8
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:50,201
Everyone calls me when they need a lift.

9
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:57,481
The quiet kid from the back seat...

10
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,521
...is the one who brings everyone home.
